          %h4#on_a_symplectic_manifold__the_topological_particle On a symplectic manifold – The topological particle
          %p
            For
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi X
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X
            a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+manifold"} smooth manifold
            we may regard its cotangent bundle
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi 𝔞
                  %mo =
                  %msup
                    %mi T
                    %mo *
                  %mi X
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathfrak{a} = T^* X
            as a Lie 0-algebroid and the canonical 2-form
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
