            %p
              The corresponding
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%E2%88%9E-Lie+algebroid+cocycle"} ∞-Lie algebroid cocycle
              is
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
