                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo →
                    %mi ℝ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} S : \Omega^\bullet(X, \mathfrak{P}(X,\pi)) \to \mathbb{R}
              is the actional functional of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Poisson+sigma-model"} Poisson sigma-model
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi S
