          %h3#on_higher_extensions_of_the_super_poincare_lie_algebra__supergravity On higher extensions of the super Poincare Lie algebra – supergravity
          %p
            See
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%27Auria-Fre+formulation+of+supergravity"} D'Auria-Fre formulation of supergravity
            for the moment.
          %h2#related_concepts Related concepts
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%E2%88%9E-Lie+algebroid+cocycle"} ∞-Lie algebroid cocycle
            %li
