          %h2#references References
          %p
            A classical reference on transgression of differential forms from the fiber to the base of a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fiber+bundle"} fiber bundle
            is section 9 of.
          %ul#Borel
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Armand+Borel"}> Armand Borel
              ,
              %em Topology of Lie groups and characteristic classes
              Bull. Amer. Math. Soc. Volume 61, Number 5 (1955), 397-432. (
              %a{:href => "http://projecteuclid.org/euclid.bams/1183520007"}> EUCLID
              )
          %p
            The general definition of Chern-Simons element on
            = succeed "-Lie" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mn ∞
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \infty
            = succeed "-Lie" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
