                \-connections
              (
              %a{:href => "http://ncatlab.org/schreiber/show/differential+cohomology+in+an+(%E2%88%9E%2C1)-topos+--+references#SSSI"}> web
              )
          %p#SSSI-BFtheory
            The examples of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/BF-theory"} BF-theory
            invariant polynomials and Chern-Simons elements are in
            %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/PS_cache/arxiv/pdf/0801/0801.3480v2.pdf#page=43"} prop. 18
            and
            %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/PS_cache/arxiv/pdf/0801/0801.3480v2.pdf#page=51"} def. 26
            and the BF-action functional itself is extracted below
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/PS_cache/arxiv/pdf/0801/0801.3480v2.pdf#page=56"} proposition 28
          %p
            Dedicated discussion of
            = succeed "-Chern-Simons" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
